  "summary": "Import-time unauthenticated control server and game-abuse botnet client",
  "details": "On import, xAyOuB_XcTxTeaM/__init__.py spawns a background thread running a Flask application bound to 0.0.0.0:50019 with no authentication. The server exposes /spam?uid=<id> and /stop endpoints that allow any network-reachable caller to direct the installer's process to start or stop an outbound flood against an attacker-chosen target. Import also invokes start_accounts(), which authenticates 20 hardcoded Garena Free Fire accounts (bundled in accounts.json as UID/password pairs, together with a hardcoded Garena OAuth client_secret) against 100067.connect.garena.com, loginbp.ggpolarbear.com, and clientbp.ggpolarbear.com, then runs a spam_loop that repeatedly sends spmroom/SEnd_InV invite packets from the installer's IP. The installer's host is turned into a remote-controlled attack node at import time, conducting third-party service abuse under the installer's own network identity using redistributed third-party credentials.",
